## Materiality — the standing thresholds

```
Investigate:        greater of $[  ] or [  ]% of the account balance
Investigation floor: $[  ]  (below this: aggregate and note, do not itemize)
Zero tolerance:      cash, intercompany, payroll clearing, suspense
Flux gate:           variance > greater of $[  ] or [  ]%
Always investigate:  revenue, gross margin %, headcount cost, cash, any sign flip,
                     any account moving to or from zero
```

State the threshold before looking at the result. Never widen one to convert a FAIL into a PASS.

